{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":183,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":183,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""}],"family_name":"七神","given_name":"凛","family_name_jp":"七神","given_name_jp":"リン","family_name_kr":"나나가미","given_name_kr":"린","family_name_en":"Nanagami","given_name_en":"Rin","family_name_zh_tw":"七神","given_name_zh_tw":"琳","family_name_cn":"七神","given_name_cn":"凛","nick_name":"","momo_talk_signature":"","main_relation":64,"relation":[65],"age":1,"grade":"三年生","height":1,"birthday":"11-01","hobby":"","designer":"Hwansang","illustrator":"Hwansang","character_voice":"大原沙耶香","character_voice_cn":"水原","release_date":null,"release_date_cn":null,"release_date_global":null,"school":12,"weapon_type":"","is_install":false,"is_install_cn":false,"is_install_global":false,"is_npc":true,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Large","special_appearance":false,"spine":[6,129,858,957,947],"model":[133],"voice":[{"description":"Rin_R52_1_EventLobby_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"現在、虚妄のサンクトゥム攻略戦が進行中です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/gcjKxXKAw5Y8TGHfS2N11xFtjaZqdxJv.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R52_1_EventLobby_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"虚妄のサンクトゥムで収集した敵のデータは、引き続き分析を行っております。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/fn6RGqbqz7PfL8jyJ4P7vZb7sKAwqg09.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R52_1_EventLobby_3","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"虚妄のサンクトゥムの破壊を急がなければ、学園都市の未来は……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/osTCeM71wfgN8LmoDVXKs0YIlZd8fs6l.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R52_1_EventLobby_4","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"これはキヴォトス全域に降りかかった災禍……。 虚妄のサンクトゥム攻略戦には、シャーレの力が必要です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/dlzjPt63M8iifKGNY3VXrLOkbKiIvBfu.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R52_1_EventLobby_5","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"時間に余裕はありませんが……。落ち着いて、 一つひとつ解決していきましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/i5AlaRVbhouXuZ5Tc1SPwlUd49scvUJN.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R52_1_EventLogin_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"虚妄のサンクトゥム攻略戦、開始いたします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/zsuNbEDlCR0Z3j7yrW7swwGm6PSQS3VX.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R52_1_EventLogin_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"お待ちしておりました、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/XaGizejFH8JbyERnTsrUpE2zJpVzBe5u.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R52_1_WorldRaid_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"こちらが現時点での虚妄のサンクトゥムの状況です。先生、攻略を開始する地点を決定してください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/fxM5B4Si7fus4P0NWQjjCjAJ2YBl8sA7.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R52_1_WorldRaid_2","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"この虚妄のサンクトゥムでは、まだ最後の戦闘が残っています。くれぐれも油断は禁物です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/4qE74Yta2yt6NLal0zXniTUWMulhlQyw.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R52_1_WorldRaid_3","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"これで一か所、攻略が完了しました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/jcoM6yf17n9cq4usCad03PKkuVM45U1P.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R52_1_WorldRaid_4","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"全ての虚妄のサンクトゥムを攻略しました。先生、お疲れ様でした。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/ycl8XKpHkzwBaDZCu1024fYvyvWlXPf4.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R53_2_EventLobby_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"お呼びですか、先生？それで、ご用件は…？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/qfcyv4BlT9H12HVXE8noyEvDNk28etbC.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R53_2_EventLobby_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"多くの生徒が協力してくれたおかげで、 復興は順調です。 シャーレにお願いして正解でした。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/7FB9voZNHlWZNTJXzPBqQhaerTMvjTC0.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R53_2_EventLobby_3_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"…そのご様子ですと、体調は問題なさそうですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/1m9WQLelWniUUGMhwVcbLBxMMdNWns4Q.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R53_2_EventLobby_3_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"…安心、しました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/q1NFTEFKYP0lvoZQk7ULm0GzVi88TrF5.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R53_2_EventLobby_4","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"崩れた建物は建て直すことができますが、 失った健康は取り戻せません。 決して、ご無理はなさらずに。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/F12sE6NZZeoTQfVoznVhO0J0mhO3qYer.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R53_2_EventLocation_Act_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"市民の安全を確保するためにも、居住区域の復旧を急ぎましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/hkHXDDjN6ydWplXh8S5sQMvYVd56Rr7p.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R53_2_EventLocation_Act_2","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"アユム、あっ……いえ、調停室長。この地域の復旧状況を報告してください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/4ccttRHxcRbiGrtvPCizMUbxA3cieTT9.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R53_2_EventLocation_Act_3","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"…………モモカ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/MUiHjC30GpR7qkpKiYcY4GFCg16SWQsi.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R53_2_EventLogin_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"こんにちは、先生。こちらでD.U.シラトリ区の 復旧作業を行っております。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/a2JDeW3m5YBAGDfW5gmvQVXcw4YwQrQV.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R53_2_EventLogin_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"ここがD.U.シラトリ区です。 どこも状況は似たようなものですが、 こちらの区も復旧を急がなければいけませんね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/TusKdIEv9tFCHvLqkVU88FC64d0O7usD.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R53_2_EventLogin_Season_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"復旧は順調ですね。 この調子でしたら、じきに元の町並みを取り戻せるでしょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/nZnBBstnEMz2dix3u6CdI1fyI11iT5EZ.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R53_2_EventLogin_Season_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"復旧作業も終わりが見えてきました。 先生のご尽力に感謝いたします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/4awXO05Nzng6BEQUhhMlz9ivpwuMVmXu.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_R53_2_EventLogin_Season_End","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"シラトリ区の復旧作業は完了いたしました。 よろしければ、ご一緒に現場を確認しませんか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/6dEYFyGfU4diWYgizncLN3oYr294pLG6.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_RaidLobby_In_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"お待ちしておりました。先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/EmXyJrQXROMLGqyE19VPztAlYnc0O6wt.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_RaidLobby_In_2","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"キヴォトスで行われる様々な事件の数々を、「シャーレ」に担当してほしいのです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/yiNyyJNW0VsmdoMN325T1iludHSzPqZ0.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_RaidLobby_Talk_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"早速始めましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/UIG28dTDgpeg7tj7jUDIQLccwvCePsNQ.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_RaidLobby_Talk_2","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"このような事件が存在することが許せません。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/0RUikT8d3facPOPsCjL1pr5dvM3qJml1.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_RaidLobby_Talk_3","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"仕方ありません。今手が空いているのは、「シャーレ」だけですから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/vb9ngxgwPRN7rdd3tXz82Yh293jUnPBg.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_RaidLobby_Talk_4","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"苦労させてしまっていることは承知しております、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/y2xjgD58hk8H80Nyw6iKa8VbAjhvAWHM.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_RaidLobby_Talk_5","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"……。お疲れ様です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/BoLvyKNjJvJB3XLCbMVGkqGzM0947UsZ.ogg"},{"description":"Rin_RaidLobby_Talk_6","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"先生のご活躍、勉強になります。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/uIh9OSC0xdxumu3EQqOaATHLlkHp85sl.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_EventLobby_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"この格好、ですか？ …は、はい。ありがとうございます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_EventLobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_EventLobby_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"疲れていないといえば嘘になりますが… 大丈夫です。任務には支障をきたしませんので。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_EventLobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_EventLobby_3","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"この規模のオーパーツを占領するのは、決して簡単ではありませんが…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_EventLobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_EventLobby_4","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"キヴォトスの未来のため、 この任務は必ず成功させなければなりません。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_EventLobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_EventLogin_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"先生、ウトナピシュティムブリッジは現在待機中です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_EventLogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_EventLogin_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"アトラ・ハシースの箱舟占領戦、進行中です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_EventLogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_EventLogin_Season_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"こうしている今も、時間は刻一刻と過ぎていきます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_EventLogin_Season_1.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_EventLogin_Season_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"残された時間はあと僅かです。 迅速に任務を遂行しましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_EventLogin_Season_2.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_TileClear_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"分析を進めます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_TileClear_1.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_TileErosion_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"特定の座標で浸食濃度が上昇しました！ご注意ください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_TileErosion_1.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_TileErosion_2","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"浸食濃度が正常値に戻りました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_TileErosion_2.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_TileOccupy_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"この拠点を占領します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_TileOccupy_1.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_TileOccupy_2","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"恐らく重要な拠点かと。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_TileOccupy_2.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_TileOccupy_3","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"現時点をもって、当該地区の全拠点を占領しました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_TileOccupy_3.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_TileReward","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"リソースを確保しました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_TileReward.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_TileUpgrade_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"こちらの掌握レベルを上げます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_TileUpgrade_1.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_ZoneOpen_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"アトラ・ハシースの箱舟占領戦、開始します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_ZoneOpen_1.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_ZoneOpen_2","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"次の地区へのルートを確保しました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_ZoneOpen_2.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_1_ZoneOpen_3","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"最終地区へのルートを確保しました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_1_ZoneOpen_3.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"ウトナピシュティムの主砲、目標に照準を定めました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_3.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_4","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"そう長くは保ちそうにありません。チャンスは一度きりです......！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_4.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_6","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"発射！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_6.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_10","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"アトラ・ハシースの方舟の崩壊に向かっています！先生、生徒を地上へ避難させてください！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_10.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_14","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"すべての生徒が無事に避難したことを確認しました！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_14.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_15","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"先生、急いで避難してください！そこはもう崩れます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_15.ogg"},{"description":"NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_16","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"私も避難します。先生、地上でお会いしましょう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/NP0097_R53_MainScenario_Battle_16.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_1_01","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_1_01.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_1_02","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_1_02.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_1_03","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_1_03.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_1_04","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_1_04.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_2_01","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_2_01.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_2_02","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_2_02.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_3_01","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_3_01.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_3_02","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_3_02.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_3_03","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_3_03.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_3_04","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_3_04.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_4_01","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_4_01.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_4_02","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_4_02.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_4_03","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_4_03.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_5_01","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_5_01.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_5_02","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_5_02.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_6_01","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_6_01.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_6_02","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_6_02.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_6_03","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/Tutorial_6_03.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"rin_raidlobby_in_1","category":"other","text":"老师，等您很久了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/M9pD2cNoNhasMYv55Q2lmz4r8BvbBIK7.ogg"},{"description":"rin_raidlobby_in_2","category":"other","text":"在基沃托斯发生的各种案件，我们希望【沙勒】能出面解决。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/Kt8BnbhHFD9jg0znS7UrZ7yyrHXmOOAW.ogg"},{"description":"rin_raidlobby_talk_1","category":"other","text":"那我们赶快开始吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/8I5znPjC4Ll5R6AF3FjpAlUvy1sli1he.ogg"},{"description":"rin_raidlobby_talk_2","category":"other","text":"绝不能容许这样的事情发生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/88LiirDtRo6oyQoWixkT29zAvaAvVToc.ogg"},{"description":"rin_raidlobby_talk_3","category":"other","text":"实在是没办法。现在能腾得出手的，也就只有沙勒了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/VeD7b3fSlxPWpU2QWaQOiimAXP0JXAqt.ogg"},{"description":"rin_raidlobby_talk_4","category":"other","text":"您一直以来的辛劳奔走我们都看在眼里，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/FwTdmx8CPGSjENpOCteDaBzBUUegRwVX.ogg"},{"description":"rin_raidlobby_talk_5","category":"other","text":"……辛苦您了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/cJeLwJNZKaaRAiamXjExd5YPNQPSQPKG.ogg"},{"description":"rin_raidlobby_talk_6","category":"other","text":"老师的出色表现是我们的榜样。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/6yfENgcV2o7YxDhfMtpSTuyexiW2pL6R.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_1_01","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_1_01.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_1_02","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_1_02.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_1_03","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_1_03.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_1_04","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_1_04.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_2_01","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_2_01.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_2_02","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_2_02.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_3_01","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_3_01.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_3_02","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_3_02.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_3_03","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_3_03.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_3_04","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_3_04.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_4_01","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_4_01.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_4_02","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_4_02.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_4_03","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_4_03.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_5_01","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_5_01.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_5_02","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_5_02.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_6_01","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_6_01.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_6_02","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_6_02.ogg"},{"description":"tutorial_6_03","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/tutorial_6_03.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r52_1_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"正在攻略虚妄圣所。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r52_1_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r52_1_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"正在分析守卫虚妄圣所的敌方单位数据。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r52_1_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r52_1_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"必须尽快摧毁圣所， 这样才能守护基沃 托斯……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r52_1_eventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r52_1_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"如果想攻略 遍布基沃托斯的虚妄圣所……就必须需要沙勒的帮助。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r52_1_eventlobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r52_1_eventlobby_5","category":"event","text":"虽然时间紧迫……但还是冷静下来，逐一击破吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r52_1_eventlobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r52_1_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"虚妄圣所攻略战现在开始。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r52_1_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r52_1_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"一直在等您，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r52_1_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r52_1_worldraid_1","category":"other","text":"这是我们正在攻略中的圣所的状态。 老师，请选择开始攻略的地点吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r52_1_worldraid_1.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r52_1_worldraid_2","category":"other","text":"这处圣所只剩下最后一场战斗， 请不要掉以轻心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r52_1_worldraid_2.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r52_1_worldraid_3","category":"other","text":"已攻略此处圣所。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r52_1_worldraid_3.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r52_1_worldraid_4","category":"other","text":"已成功攻略所有圣所。 老师，您辛苦了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r52_1_worldraid_4.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r53_2_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"老师，您刚刚叫我了吗？ 是有什么事吗……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r53_2_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r53_2_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"多亏了各位学员的协助， 修复工作才能顺利完成。果然拜托沙勒是没错的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r53_2_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r53_2_eventlobby_3_1","category":"event","text":"既然您还有精神捉弄人， 那身体应该没什么问题吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r53_2_eventlobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r53_2_eventlobby_3_2","category":"event","text":"……真是太好了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r53_2_eventlobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r53_2_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"虽然毁坏的建筑可以重建，但失去的健康可是很难恢复的。所以请不要逞强。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r53_2_eventlobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r53_2_eventlocation_act_1","category":"other","text":"优先修复居住区域。为了确保市民的安全，尽快修复吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r53_2_eventlocation_act_1.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r53_2_eventlocation_act_2","category":"other","text":"步……不，调解室主任，请确认这片区域的修复情况。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r53_2_eventlocation_act_2.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r53_2_eventlocation_act_3","category":"other","text":"桃可……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r53_2_eventlocation_act_3.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r53_2_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"老师，欢迎您。 这里正在进行D.U.白鸟区的修复工作。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r53_2_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r53_2_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"这里是D.U.的白鸟区。虽然各处都受灾严重， 但这里的修复工作最为急迫。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r53_2_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r53_2_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"修复已经取得了很大进展。照这样的速度， D.U.也将很快恢复原貌。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r53_2_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r53_2_eventlogin_season_2","category":"event","text":"修复工作已经接近尾声，也要感谢辛苦工作的老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r53_2_eventlogin_season_2.ogg"},{"description":"rin_r53_2_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"白鸟区的修复工作已经完成了。方便的话，要四处看看吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/rin_r53_2_eventlogin_season_end.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"您说这身衣服很适合吗？……啊，好的……谢谢您。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"虽然有些累……但没关系，不会影响到执行任务的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"占领这样的神秘古物并不容易，不过……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_eventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"为了基沃托斯的安全，这次任务必须成功。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_eventlobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"老师，乌特纳比斯汀舰桥已经准备好了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"正在进行阿特拉哈西斯方舟占领战。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"时间正在一分一秒流逝，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_eventlogin_season_2","category":"event","text":"剩下的时间不多了……必须立刻执行任务。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_eventlogin_season_2.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_tileclear_1","category":"other","text":"开始分析。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_tileclear_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_tileerosion_1","category":"other","text":"请注意，特定坐标的侵蚀浓度上升了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_tileerosion_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_tileerosion_2","category":"other","text":"侵蚀浓度已恢复正常。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_tileerosion_2.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_tileoccupy_1","category":"other","text":"占领该据点。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_tileoccupy_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_tileoccupy_2","category":"other","text":"这处据点看起来很重要。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_tileoccupy_2.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_tileoccupy_3","category":"other","text":"已占领所在地区的所有据点。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_tileoccupy_3.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_tilereward","category":"other","text":"已确保资源。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_tilereward.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_tileupgrade_1","category":"other","text":"提高该据点的控制等级。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_tileupgrade_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_zoneopen_1","category":"other","text":"阿特拉哈西斯方舟占领战，现在开始。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_zoneopen_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_zoneopen_2","category":"other","text":"已确保通往下一地区的路线。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_zoneopen_2.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_1_zoneopen_3","category":"other","text":"已确保通往最终地区的路线，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_1_zoneopen_3.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_mainscenario_battle_3","category":"battle","text":"老师，乌特纳比斯汀的主炮已瞄准目标。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_mainscenario_battle_3.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_mainscenario_battle_4","category":"battle","text":"这里坚持不了太久， 我们只有一次机会……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_mainscenario_battle_4.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_mainscenario_battle_6","category":"battle","text":"发射！！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_mainscenario_battle_6.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_mainscenario_battle_10","category":"battle","text":"阿特拉哈西斯方舟正在解体！ 老师，请立刻带领学员们撤离到地面！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_mainscenario_battle_10.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_mainscenario_battle_14","category":"battle","text":"所有学员均已安全到达地面！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np0097_r53_mainscenario_battle_14.ogg"},{"description":"np0097_r53_mainscenario_battle_15","category":"battle","text":"老师！请尽快离开！ 那里马上就要坍塌了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%83%E7%A5%9E%20%E5%87%9B/original/cn/np009